        "nobel_worthiness": "Optical lattice clocks combine ingenious control of atomic motion with exceptional frequency stability and accuracy. They have become powerful tools for fundamental tests and precision measurement.",
        "attribution": "Katori established the optical lattice clock concept and its realization; Ye made major independent advances in building and refining these clocks. The two-person attribution is persuasive.",
