      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Optical coherence tomography created a noninvasive way to image tissue structure at high resolution and transformed both biomedical optics and clinical diagnostics.",
        "attribution": "The credited trio reflects the closely connected development of the method and its early demonstration. The shared attribution is credible.",
        "maturity": "OCT is established in clinical practice and research, with decades of validation and continued technical development.",
        "uncertainties": [
